    "A descriptive activity-load proxy, not a clinical or training-grade load measure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein beschreibender Näherungswert für deine Aktivität, kein klinisches oder trainingsgerechtes Lastmaß."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A descriptive activity-load proxy, not a clinical or training-grade load measure."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Een beschrijvende benadering van je activiteit, geen klinische maat en geen maat voor trainingsbelasting."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "활동 부하를 설명하는 참고 지표로, 임상용이나 훈련용 부하 측정값이 아니에요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una aproximación descriptiva de la carga de actividad, no una medida clínica ni de nivel deportivo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A descriptive wellness proxy, not a training-grade or clinical recovery measure.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein beschreibender Näherungswert für dein Wohlbefinden, kein trainings- oder klinikgerechtes Erholungsmaß."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
