            "value": "Se necesita un proveedor en el servidor"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A single 0–100 read on last night's sleep — its length, depth and how settled it was.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein einzelner Wert von 0 bis 100 für letzte Nacht: Dauer, Tiefe und wie ruhig der Schlaf war."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A single 0 to 100 read on last night's sleep: its length, depth and how settled it was."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eén waarde van 0 tot 100 voor de slaap van afgelopen nacht: duur, diepte en hoe rustig hij was."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "지난밤 수면을 0에서 100 사이의 값 하나로 보여줘요: 수면 시간, 깊이, 얼마나 안정적이었는지."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una sola cifra de 0 a 100 sobre el sueño de anoche: su duración, su profundidad y lo tranquilo que fue."
          }
        }
      }
    },
