    "Create a WHOOP developer app at developer.whoop.com, then paste its Client ID and Client Secret here. They are stored encrypted on your server and never on this iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lege unter developer.whoop.com eine WHOOP-Entwickler-App an und füge hier deren Client-ID und Client-Secret ein. Sie werden verschlüsselt auf deinem Server gespeichert, nie auf diesem iPhone."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Create a WHOOP developer app at developer.whoop.com, then paste its Client ID and Client Secret here. They are stored encrypted on your server and never on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maak een WHOOP-ontwikkelaarsapp aan op developer.whoop.com en plak hier de Client-ID en het clientgeheim. Ze worden versleuteld op je server bewaard en nooit op deze iPhone."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "developer.whoop.com에서 WHOOP 개발자 앱을 만든 뒤, 클라이언트 ID와 클라이언트 시크릿을 여기에 붙여 넣어 주세요. 이 정보는 내 서버에 암호화되어 저장되며 이 iPhone에는 저장되지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Crea una app de desarrollador de WHOOP en developer.whoop.com y pega aquí su ID de cliente y su secreto de cliente. Se guardan cifrados en tu servidor y nunca en este iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
