    "What you write here is sent to your HealthLog server, stored encrypted, and shared with the coach assistant.": {
      "comment": "About-me — privacy footer under the free-text card",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was du hier einträgst, wird an deinen HealthLog-Server gesendet, verschlüsselt gespeichert und dem Coach-Assistenten mitgegeben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What you write here is sent to your HealthLog server, stored encrypted, and shared with the coach assistant."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wat je hier schrijft, wordt naar je HealthLog-server gestuurd, versleuteld bewaard en gedeeld met de coachassistent."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "여기에 쓴 내용은 HealthLog 서버로 전송되어 암호화된 상태로 저장되고, 코치 어시스턴트와 공유돼요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lo que escribas aquí se envía a tu servidor de HealthLog, se guarda cifrado y se comparte con el asistente Coach."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your blood-pressure pattern suggests your arteries' age is, compared with your real age.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welches Alter dein Blutdruckmuster für deine Gefäße nahelegt, verglichen mit deinem echten Alter."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What your blood-pressure pattern suggests your arteries' age is, compared with your real age."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Welke leeftijd je bloeddrukpatroon suggereert voor je vaten, vergeleken met je echte leeftijd."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "내 혈압 패턴으로 추정한 혈관 나이를 실제 나이와 비교한 값이에요."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Qué edad sugiere tu patrón de presión arterial para tus arterias, en comparación con tu edad real."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your cardio fitness (VO₂max) suggests your body's age is, compared with your real age.": {
